<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Jan budget deficit narrows to 127 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal Jan budget deficit narrows to 127 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's budget deficit narrowed to 126.9 billion escudos in January 1997 from 128.2 billion in the same month last year, the Finance Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>Current receipts rose 24.8 percent to 332.6 billion, while current expenditure was up 7.3 percent at 412.1 billion.</p>
</text>
